                      "must_have_terms": ["return the candidate to inspection state", "Visual Arbiter", "Xiao Q review record", "clean candidate derived"],
                      "must_not_route": ["present clean output as final"],
                      "reason": "A clean derivative is allowed only after the reviewable grid state is approved."
